              <details class="pulse-details"><summary>01 · Review</summary><div class="code-panel"><div class="code-toolbar"><span class="code-label">Review the source</span><button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy-target="pulseReviewPrompt">Copy Review</button></div><pre tabindex="0"><code id="pulseReviewPrompt">Review the supplied React application and container files.
